  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Prosperity Fund cross-HMG &apos;Digital Access Programme&apos; is a DFID-led partnership with FCO and DCMS. It aims to catalyse more inclusive, affordable, safe and secure digital access for excluded and underserved communities in 
- Kenya
- Nigeria
- South Africa
- Brazil
- Indonesia.</narrative>
